# Swiss Ephemeris Checksums
# Generate with: sha256sum *.se1 > ephemeris-checksums.sha256
# Verify with: sha256sum -c ephemeris-checksums.sha256
#
# These are the expected SHA-256 checksums for the Swiss Ephemeris files.
# After downloading, verify integrity with the download scripts (-verify flag)
# or run: sha256sum -c ephemeris-checksums.sha256
#
# NOTE: Replace these placeholder values with actual checksums after first download:
#   cd app/src-tauri/ephemeris && sha256sum *.se1 > ../../scripts/ephemeris-checksums.sha256
